    "created_at": "2016-05-27T17:33:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-27T17:33:26Z",
    "body": "Assuming the worker has its origin being set to an opaque origin and loading the script is allowed by CORS, why not?\n\nWorkers created using object urls work already even in sandboxed iframes, at least in implementations,\nnot sure what the spec says.\n",
