    "created_at": "2016-05-27T19:24:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-27T19:24:07Z",
    "body": "https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=78648 seems to have the discussion for implementing this different origin-for-blob-url behavior in webkit/blink. Possibly this should just be updated in the URL and/or File API specs.\n\nAnd since then apparently workers in opaque origins has been working for a long time already (no idea how much they are used though), it makes less sense to add new restrictions here. I didn't realize implementation didn't match spec in this regard.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
